[
  {
    "id": "jhn11-16",
    "chapter": "JHN11",
    "verse": 16,
    "text": "Thomas therefore, who is called Didymus, said to his fellow disciples, “Let’s also go, that we may die with him.”",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn11.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN11.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:b50fad0b883b88cb38d452741f23a0ba65842d1ae296fa04138ed0b7999c6a23"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn14-5",
    "chapter": "JHN14",
    "verse": 5,
    "text": "Thomas said to him, “Lord, we don’t know where you are going. How can we know the way?”",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn14.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN14.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:22f3cd937229cfc8a4b4dedb84189555d58a2b44b71d10ad194be42758443a57"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn14-6",
    "chapter": "JHN14",
    "verse": 6,
    "text": "Jesus said to him, “I am the way, the truth, and the life. No one comes to the Father, except through me.",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn14.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN14.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:22f3cd937229cfc8a4b4dedb84189555d58a2b44b71d10ad194be42758443a57"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn20-24",
    "chapter": "JHN20",
    "verse": 24,
    "text": "But Thomas, one of the twelve, called Didymus, wasn’t with them when Jesus came.",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn20.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN20.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:12795753543a5d9c697331e7b02f866b02cb441b50eea9980c81340307a7f1bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn20-25",
    "chapter": "JHN20",
    "verse": 25,
    "text": "The other disciples therefore said to him, “We have seen the Lord!” But he said to them, “Unless I see in his hands the print of the nails, put my finger into the print of the nails, and put my hand into his side, I will not believe.”",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn20.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN20.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:12795753543a5d9c697331e7b02f866b02cb441b50eea9980c81340307a7f1bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn20-26",
    "chapter": "JHN20",
    "verse": 26,
    "text": "After eight days, again his disciples were inside and Thomas was with them. Jesus came, the doors being locked, and stood in the middle, and said, “Peace be to you.”",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn20.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN20.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:12795753543a5d9c697331e7b02f866b02cb441b50eea9980c81340307a7f1bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn20-27",
    "chapter": "JHN20",
    "verse": 27,
    "text": "Then he said to Thomas, “Reach here your finger, and see my hands. Reach here your hand, and put it into my side. Don’t be unbelieving, but believing.”",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn20.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN20.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:12795753543a5d9c697331e7b02f866b02cb441b50eea9980c81340307a7f1bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn20-28",
    "chapter": "JHN20",
    "verse": 28,
    "text": "Thomas answered him, “My Lord and my God!”",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn20.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN20.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:12795753543a5d9c697331e7b02f866b02cb441b50eea9980c81340307a7f1bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn20-29",
    "chapter": "JHN20",
    "verse": 29,
    "text": "Jesus said to him, “Because you have seen me, you have believed. Blessed are those who have not seen and have believed.”",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn20.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN20.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:12795753543a5d9c697331e7b02f866b02cb441b50eea9980c81340307a7f1bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn20-30",
    "chapter": "JHN20",
    "verse": 30,
    "text": "Therefore Jesus did many other signs in the presence of his disciples, which are not written in this book;",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn20.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN20.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:12795753543a5d9c697331e7b02f866b02cb441b50eea9980c81340307a7f1bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn20-31",
    "chapter": "JHN20",
    "verse": 31,
    "text": "but these are written that you may believe that Jesus is the Christ, the Son of God, and that believing you may have life in his name.",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn20.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN20.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:12795753543a5d9c697331e7b02f866b02cb441b50eea9980c81340307a7f1bb"
  },
  {
    "id": "jhn21-2",
    "chapter": "JHN21",
    "verse": 2,
    "text": "Simon Peter, Thomas called Didymus, Nathanael of Cana in Galilee, and the sons of Zebedee, and two others of his disciples were together.",
    "file": "thomas-web-jhn21.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JHN21.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:29a41052b8349b961e9113cd20fc191057787a22c44f88c64f7ea829d04d51fc"
  },
  {
    "id": "mat10-3",
    "chapter": "MAT10",
    "verse": 3,
    "text": "Philip; Bartholomew; Thomas; Matthew the tax collector; James the son of Alphaeus; Lebbaeus, who was also called Thaddaeus;",
    "file": "thomas-web-mat10.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/MAT10.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:5ef572e917ed7f0c6535f1f8f4299fa28bc7e1ac31bc60829ab3457a1d12725d"
  },
  {
    "id": "mrk03-18",
    "chapter": "MRK03",
    "verse": 18,
    "text": "Andrew; Philip; Bartholomew; Matthew; Thomas; James, the son of Alphaeus; Thaddaeus; Simon the Zealot;",
    "file": "thomas-web-mrk03.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/MRK03.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:4d0091abc92a3d99f6a9642614e8589ad359cfafea983fbdea6db70bd4722c64"
  },
  {
    "id": "luk06-15",
    "chapter": "LUK06",
    "verse": 15,
    "text": "Matthew; Thomas; James the son of Alphaeus; Simon who was called the Zealot;",
    "file": "thomas-web-luk06.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/LUK06.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:d2494d58588c4cc852ceae988b23da8e6ba862598d627011837a9bc4f5fdf73b"
  },
  {
    "id": "luk06-41",
    "chapter": "LUK06",
    "verse": 41,
    "text": "Why do you see the speck of chaff that is in your brother’s eye, but don’t consider the beam that is in your own eye?",
    "file": "thomas-web-luk06.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/LUK06.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:d2494d58588c4cc852ceae988b23da8e6ba862598d627011837a9bc4f5fdf73b"
  },
  {
    "id": "luk06-42",
    "chapter": "LUK06",
    "verse": 42,
    "text": "Or how can you tell your brother, ‘Brother, let me remove the speck of chaff that is in your eye,’ when you yourself don’t see the beam that is in your own eye? You hypocrite! First remove the beam from your own eye, and then you can see clearly to remove the speck of chaff that is in your brother’s eye.",
    "file": "thomas-web-luk06.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/LUK06.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:d2494d58588c4cc852ceae988b23da8e6ba862598d627011837a9bc4f5fdf73b"
  },
  {
    "id": "act01-13",
    "chapter": "ACT01",
    "verse": 13,
    "text": "When they had come in, they went up into the upper room where they were staying, that is Peter, John, James, Andrew, Philip, Thomas, Bartholomew, Matthew, James the son of Alphaeus, Simon the Zealot, and Judas the son of James.",
    "file": "thomas-web-act01.html",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/ACT01.htm",
    "sourceVersion": "engwebp publisher snapshot 2026-11-05",
    "rights": "Public domain",
    "checksum": "sha256:7d97c60fcd47e9d18c394d5e70a75c8fae86bd3b72de1e4c4d4f00c299be7673"
  }
]
